      "body": "since I started i have been giving cssie both boobs at feed time which usually lasts an hour and half. She is putting on 8oz a week which the health visitor is happy with. The boob dilemma has come up since meeting up with some friends who say they only feed off one boob at a time. Just feel confused  😐 as i was feeling that everything was going well in that way.",
